{"title": "Samsung Odyssey+", "parts": {"header": "<div class=sd><div class=sd-grid><div class=sd-head><a class=sd-maker href=\"https://www.samsung.com/\">Samsung</a><h1 id=\"_top\">Samsung Odyssey+</h1><p class=sd-type>VR headset with two tracking cameras and a 1 kHz IMU</p><p class=sd-chips><span class=\"cl cam\" title=\"Monado dataset authors\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"1.5\" y=\"4\" width=\"13\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"2.6\"/><path d=\"M5.5 4l1-1.6h3l1 1.6\"/></svg><span class=t><b>OmniVision</b> <span class=p>OV7251</span> <span class=x>×2</span></span> <a class=cl-src href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/collabora/monado-slam-datasets\">Dataset</a></span><span class=\"cl imu\" title=\"headset calibration file in the dataset\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.2\"/><path d=\"M6.5 4V2M9.5 4V2M6.5 14v-2M9.5 14v-2M4 6.5H2M4 9.5H2M14 6.5h-2M14 9.5h-2\"/></svg><span class=t><b>TDK InvenSense</b> <span class=p>ICM-20602</span></span> <a class=cl-src href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/collabora/monado-slam-datasets\">Dataset</a></span></p></div><figure class=sd-plate><div class=sd-frame><img src=\"/media/sensors/samsung-odyssey-plus/samsung-odyssey-plus.jpg\" alt=\"Samsung HMD Odyssey+ headset\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\"></div><figcaption><a href=\"https://news.samsung.com/br/samsung-apresenta-o-novo-hmd-odyssey-no-brasil\">Photo: Samsung Newsroom Brasil</a></figcaption></figure><div class=sd-cta><div class=sd-buttons><a class=\"sd-btn primary\" href=\"https://news.samsung.com/br/samsung-apresenta-o-novo-hmd-odyssey-no-brasil\">Samsung announcement</a><a class=sd-btn href=\"#specifications\">All specs (5)</a></div></div><div class=sd-specs><dl class=sd-rows><div class=sd-row><dt>Cameras</dt><dd>2 × 640×480, 30 Hz, grayscale<span class=sd-tag>Dataset</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Shutter</dt><dd>Not stated<span class=sd-tag>Not published</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Field of view</dt><dd>Calibrated 119° × 95°<span class=sd-tag>Measured</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Baseline</dt><dd>105.5 mm<span class=sd-tag>Measured</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>IMU</dt><dd>About 1 kHz<span class=sd-tag>Dataset</span></dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Output</dt><dd>EuRoC layout, in the dataset<span class=sd-tag>Dataset</span></dd></div></dl><p class=sd-foot>Values from the Monado SLAM Datasets · 1 recording shown · CC BY 4.0 data</p></div></div></div>", "glance": "<p>VR headset from Samsung with two 640×480 grayscale tracking cameras and an IMU at about 1 kHz, solved from the Monado SLAM calibration data.</p><div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/hero/hero_moc_960.mp4\" poster=\"/media/hero/hero_moc_960.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>Recovered by MVIS from the Monado calibration data.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.12<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>105.5<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−0.64<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>84.1<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div><p class=sd-note>Reprojection is how far, in pixels, the detected corners lie from where the solve puts them. td is the camera–IMU time offset, and the lever arm is the camera–IMU position offset.</p><p class=sd-note>One recording shown, with no independent reference on this page. These values show what MVIS solved, not how close they are to the truth.</p>", "process": "<p>The path of the rig around the board, as MVIS solved it. To explore it:</p><ul class=list><li>Press <b>Play</b> or drag the bar to follow the path.</li><li>Use the <b>view buttons</b> to change the view.</li><li>Pick a <b>camera card</b> to put that camera on the frustum, the pyramid that shows its view.</li>